{
  "day": 8,
  "beats": {
    "boot": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Mist, the second day."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The boss received only two. The other four are gone from your computer too.",
          "where": "screen:msgs:boss"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It put them away for me. Where, it didn't say.",
          "where": "screen"
        }
      ]
    },
    "desk": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Everything on the desk is where it was. The pager stays on 0.7734."
        }
      ]
    },
    "shutdown": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A zero-second voice note. You can open it; the bar runs to the end. Nothing.",
          "where": "screen:msgs"
        }
      ]
    },
    "night": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "sfx",
          "t": "Bzz.",
          "sfx": "pager-buzz"
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "寻呼机",
          "t": "0487"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "I couldn't place this one. There's a table that reads it, inside the calculator lid."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You close your eyes. Something very light in your hand, plastic, with a click when it shuts."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The year you went abroad. The airport. Bought the day before leaving: your first phone, the number written on your palm.",
          "backdrop": "/room/dream/airport.jpg"
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "family",
          "t": "Call when you land. Doesn't have to be long. Two rings and hang up, then I know you're there."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "father",
          "t": "If the money runs short, say so."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It's enough."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The second year. The kitchen of the shared flat. Three laptops on the table: two PhDs and one master's.",
          "backdrop": "/room/dream/table.jpg"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "who": "boss",
          "t": "Wang Lai was doing cognitive science. He talked without putting his chopsticks down."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "boss",
          "t": "What the lab here builds won't be usable back home for three years. Let's go back and build it ourselves."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "boss",
          "t": "You're the only one of the three of us who can write code."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "who": "partner",
          "t": "Chen Weiwei was doing a PhD in management. Her slides were already done."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "partner",
          "t": "I've got the name: Weilai Intelligence. Easy to remember, right?"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "She wrote two characters on a napkin: 薇, 莱. Next to them, 未来 — the future."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "Two characters. There was no third one on the napkin."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "boss",
          "t": "If you stayed, the offer you've got here is top tier. I know that."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "boss",
          "t": "On the technical side, you decide. All of it. I promise."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "partner",
          "t": "The two of us handle everything else. You just build."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "Okay."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "That night you called home. Two rings, hang up. They called back: two rings, hang up. You didn't say you were coming back."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A year later every phone in every hand had turned into a slab of glass. It still worked. Nobody called the number any more."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The one on the desk now is fifteen years later. \"On the technical side, you decide\" — nobody said it again in those fifteen years."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today is over."
        }
      ]
    },
    "box": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The last little box. A broken feature phone, a flip, one corner of the screen cracked."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "It won't switch on. It doesn't need to."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
